- egui-icons, a five-glyph subset of emoji-icon-font: Copyright (c) 2014 John Slegers, licensed
  under the MIT License (fonts/emoji-icon-font-mit-license.txt).

Icons

The tab strip (crates/ui) draws Lucide's "x" and "plus" icons from their path coordinates. Both
are among the Lucide icons derived from the Feather project.

